<Pnumber><CommentaryRef Ref="key-392d2ca62c5ff4f0f3da54adcc9f29ac"/>2</Pnumber>
<P1para>
<Text>Any offence in respect of a vehicle, being an offence created under a statutory provision specified in column 2 of Schedule 1 (the general nature of which is described in column 3 thereof) is a fixed penalty offence for the purposes of Part IV of the Road Traffic Offenders (Northern Ireland) Order 1996.</Text>
</P1para>
</P1></P1group></Body></Secondary><Commentaries><Commentary Type="I" id="key-392d2ca62c5ff4f0f3da54adcc9f29ac"><Para><Text>Art. 2  in operation at 1.10.1997, see <CitationSubRef id="n4147cf7505288d18" SectionRef="article-1" URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/nisr/1997/369/article/1" Operative="true">art. 1</CitationSubRef></Text></Para></Commentary></Commentaries></Legislation>